 class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:64224e6c-8a57-4688-885a-77fd1b6c9f4f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:64224e6c-8a57-4688-885a-77fd1b6c9f4f\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In <a href=\"/wiki/Ramazith%27s_Tower\" title=\"Ramazith's Tower\">Ramazith's Tower</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>TASKS FOR WHICH I REQUIRE AID\n</p><p><br>\n- Sweeping out the main hall\n</p><p>- Removing <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Ramazith_Flamesinger\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ramazith's\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Ramazith_Flamesinger\">Ramazith's</a></span> personal effects from my chambers\n</p><p>- Placing such valuable tomes as the <a href=\"/wiki/The_Annals_of_Karsus\" title=\"The Annals of Karsus\">Annals of Karsus</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Sorcerous_Vault#The_Karsus_vault\" title=\"Sorcerous Vault\">Karsus Vault</a> for safekeeping.\n</p><p>- et al.\n</p><p><br>\nIf <a href=\"/wiki/Miklaur\" title=\"Miklaur\">Miklaur</a> cannot handle such simple matters, I ought to replace him with an animated armour or two.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714205807\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.068 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.071 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1780/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 33354/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9054/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.014/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936364/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   54.557      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   54.557      1 -total\n 63.50%   34.643      8 Template:Icon_text\n 56.41%   30.775     19 Template:Trim\n 26.36%   14.382      2 Template:Uid\n 15.85%    8.646      2 Template:Template_style\n 15.53%    8.472      3 Template:Icon_link\n 12.63%    6.890      1 Template:Main_only\n 11.79%    6.431      1 Template:Ifexist\n  9.96%    5.434      8 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:50394-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714205807 and revision id 321290. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}